    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01HNG9WJTAC5JY3JKGSBV0F3X5\" class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to create, edit, delete, and manage your email templates in the <strong>Email Templates</strong> tab. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HNG9WJTANZBQ3QZRJ4EHD43F\">Create a template</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to <strong>Content &gt; Templates</strong>.</li>\n<li>Browse the <strong>Email: saved</strong> tab and select a base template to use, or click <strong>Create</strong> to start from scratch. Alternatively, <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005254068\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">import a custom HTML template</a>.</li>\n<li>Review the template in the modal that appears; then, click <strong>Create Template</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>This takes you to the template editor where you can create and save your template. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HNG9WJTA6ANCA21W3D28Z0F3\">Edit a template</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to <strong>Content &gt; Templates</strong>.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Email: saved</strong> to view your existing templates.</li>\n<li>Click the icon of the template you’d like to edit.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Use template</strong> in the modal that appears.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>This takes you to the template editor where you can edit your content and save your template.</p>\n<p>This will not update templates that are in use in your flows or unsent campaigns. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HNG9WJTA4Z1VBVBEBQAK7S1S\">Change the name of a template</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to <strong>Content &gt;</strong><strong> Templates</strong>.</li>\n<li>Locate the template you want to update.</li>\n<li>Select the three dots on the far right-hand side.</li>\n<li>In the dropdown, select <strong>Edit Name</strong> and rename the template. <img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28723505406235\" alt=\"The Edit Name option for a template\" width=\"337\" height=\"217\" name=\"\">\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HNG9WJTA30DRY6QE8WN5YAE8\">Clone or delete a template</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Select <strong>Content &gt; Templates &gt; Email: saved</strong> to locate the template you want to clone or delete.</li>\n<li>Click the dropdown and select the option you want to take (i.e., <strong>Clone</strong> or <strong>Delete</strong>).<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28723505408923\" alt=\"The Clone option for a template\" width=\"342\" height=\"313\">\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>Deleting a template will not impact any flows or campaigns that use the template. When you use a template email in a flow or a campaign, Klaviyo makes a copy of the template, and it's no longer connected to the template found in your<em> Templates</em> tab. </p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HNG9WJTARE8CV8MR5TXZR7KS\">Save an email as a template</h2>\n<p>If you're working with either a draft campaign email or a flow email, you can save your email as a template. To save a campaign email as a template: </p>\n<ol>\n<li>Click the <strong>Content</strong> step from within an existing unsent campaign. </li>\n<li>Click the <strong>Edit Email </strong>dropdown.</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Save as Template</strong>.<strong><br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28723505411739\" alt=\"The Save as template option\" width=\"639\" height=\"143\"><br></strong>\n</li>\n<li>Enter a name for your template and click <strong>Save as Template</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Your email template is now available in the <em>Templates</em> tab.</p>\n<p>To save a flow email as a template: </p>\n<ol>\n<li>Click the <strong>Message Content</strong> tab.</li>\n<li>Click the <strong>Edit Content</strong> dropdown.</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Save as Template</strong>.</li>\n<li>Enter a name for your template and click <strong>Save as Template</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Your email template is now available in the <em>Templates</em> tab.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HNG9WJTA7MWNTVBD6YH74MZE\">Sending templates</h2>\n<p>In Klaviyo, there are 2 main ways to send your email templates to your subscribers: </p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005054847-Guide-to-Creating-and-Sending-an-Email-Campaign\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Use a campaign</a> to send an email template to a group of subscribers at the same time. </li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115002774932-Getting-Started-with-Flows\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Use a flow</a> to send an email template based on when a subscriber does something.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HNG9WJTAANSF5VVRF43QK1B7\">Switching templates</h2>\n<p>If you're working with either a draft campaign email or any flow email, you can change the template you're working with. </p>\n<ol>\n<li>Click the <strong>Content</strong> tab within the message (i.e., flow email or unsent campaign).</li>\n<li>Click the <strong>Edit Email </strong>dropdown.</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Change Template</strong>.</li>\n<li>Select an option: <strong>Drag and Drop</strong>, <strong>Text Only</strong>, or <strong>HTML</strong>, then select and edit your template.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HNG9WJTBP02Q56MDD2AQWKKP\">Additional resources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005253688\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Managing images in Klaviyo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005083887\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Create a base template</a></li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
